<td id="S5.T2.2.1.27.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">89.81</td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.27.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.27.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">77.87</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.27.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">63.50</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.2.1.28" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">ToolRM-14B</td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.28.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.28.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">76.54</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.28.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.28.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">90.27</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.28.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">77.42</td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.28.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">63.25</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>
Performance of the Qwen3 and xLAM-2 series of models in the Best-of-<math id="S5.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="S5.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(n=32)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(n=32)</annotation></semantics></math> setting on BFCL-v3.
</figcaption>
</figure>
