<section id="A1.SS4.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.4.2 </span>LLM-as-Judge Prompt</h4>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The prompt used to evaluate LLMs-as-Judges on FC-RewardBench is shown in Listing <a href="#LST2" title="Listing 2 ‣ A.4.2 LLM-as-Judge Prompt ‣ A.4 FC-RewardBench Experiment Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ ToolRM: Outcome Reward Models for Tool-Calling Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. The placeholders <span id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{tool-library}</span>, <span id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{query}</span>, <span id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{response-A}</span>, and <span id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{response-B}</span> are replaced with appropriate values.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST2" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="LST2.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
