                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">37</span>
                
                
                
              #<span id="lstnumberx58.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx58.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">ANSWER</span>:
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 2: </span>LLM-as-Judge Prompt used for FC-RewardBench evaluation</figcaption>
